                                "type": "fact",
                                "label": "What it is",
                                "body": "A command named in the third person — `hides()`, `entersTestMode()` — where a call is an order, not a description of one"
                            },
                            {
                                "type": "fact",
                                "label": "The rule",
                                "body": "Name a command in the imperative: `hide()`, `enterTestMode()`, `openFor(\\$user)` — never the third-person `hides()`, and never a participle."
                            },
                            {
                                "type": "fact",
                                "label": "How to fix it",
                                "body": "drop the -s: the call site is giving the order, not narrating it"
                            }
